# SynapseMail installer: ownership check
#
# The installer (https://your-domain/mail/) shows a code like SM-1A2B-3C4D-5E6F.
# Replace the example code below with that code, save this file, then click
# "I SAVED SETUP.KEY". Lines starting with # are ignored.
# The installer deletes this file when the installation is finished.

SM-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX
